      "kind": "provenance_and_atomicity",
      "scope": [
        "all_raw_candidate_files"
      ],
      "assessment": "当前canonical有241项；raw候选总计262个唯一ID。10个淘汰ID已有merged_candidate_ids来源映射，另有11个ID既不在树中也没有合并/排除映射：cosplay-c01-character-pose-translation, cosplay-c05-pose-variation, cosplay-c12-subject-set-overlap, field-location-reflection, light-006, mot-09, posing-adapt-to-movement-limits, posing-feet-upward-sequence, posing-person-specific-adjustment, posing-seated-variation, post-skin-dodge-burn-scope.",
      "recommendation": "为每项补明确的merged_into或excluded/demoted理由，保留来源与练习边界。建议的主要归宿：cosplay-c01作角色意图到可见动作线索的项目检查门；c05作姿势变量练习编排；c12作一次只移动一个因素的重叠排查清单；light-006作灯距实验检查；mot-09作对焦策略选择检查；posing-feet-upward-sequence作全身姿势检查序列；posing-person-specific-adjustment作舒适度/个体差异约束；posing-seated-variation作坐姿练习模板；posing-adapt-to-movement-limits合并到posing-outfit-prop-limit-negotiation并登记来源；post-skin-dodge-burn-scope并入post-skin-local-dodge-burn，保留不过度重塑验收；field-location-reflection因无direct证据只保留项目复盘提示。不要把未映射的删除误认为“无价值”或“无依赖”。"
    },
